  "description": "An ASP.NET Core middleware extension that automatically captures HTTP request/response traffic from Azure App Services and transmits it to Salt Security API for real-time security analysis and threat detection.\n\nKey Features:\n• Zero Latency Impact - Fire-and-forget async pattern with <1ms overhead per request\n• Auto-Activation - Uses IHostingStartup, requiring no code modifications to your application\n• Production Ready - Circuit breaker pattern with Polly for graceful degradation under API failures\n• High Performance - Lock-free System.Threading.Channels queue with concurrent background workers\n• Framework Support - Optimized for .NET 8.0 LTS\n• Secure by Default - Sensitive headers automatically redacted, configurable body size limits\n• Azure Optimized - Deploys as Site Extension with XDT transforms for zero-config installation\n\nArchitecture: IHostingStartup Auto-Activation → Middleware Interception → Fire-and-Forget Queue → Background Workers → Circuit-Breaker Protected API Transmission\n\nPerformance: <1ms latency impact, ~5,000 req/sec throughput with 5 workers, configurable queue up to 10,000 items with drop-oldest policy.\n\nDocumentation: Full configuration guide, troubleshooting, and architecture details available at project URL.",
